==Battleground==
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 7 seconds<sup>210f</sup>, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bears Be Back]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 31.67~36.67 seconds<sup>950f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Equip [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] as it has resistance to every single enemy here besides Teacher Bear. [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] will be useful here as well. [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] or even better, [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]], can be used to weaken Dread Bore if you are having trouble stalling it.

==Trivia==
*The Japanese name of this stage is referring to the "Boke" (Funny man) and "Tsukkomi" (Straight man) of Manzai comedy.

